- I'm going to-

00:14:12.401 --> 00:14:15.568
All right, well I was going to, sorry.

00:14:17.086 --> 00:14:18.660
- Oh, oh.
- That's all right.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:19.493
- Thank you.

00:14:19.493 --> 00:14:21.095
You are truly a gentleman.

00:14:21.095 --> 00:14:22.306
Thank you.

00:14:22.306 --> 00:14:23.328
- Okay.

00:14:23.328 --> 00:14:24.219
- Thank you.

00:14:24.219 --> 00:14:25.860
