- Okay, well I think it
would be cool to be rich,

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:35.700
but when I think of rich,

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:40.700
I think of kind of selfish
people with golden cars,

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.650
mansions, show off.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.440
When I think of rich people, I
think of kind of mean people.

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.940
