about the mean rich people,

00:14:54.930 --> 00:14:57.120
but not everybody that is rich is mean.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.840
- Yeah, but I mean like most
of them are like show off,

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.267
