so much more money than you.

00:15:03.267 --> 00:15:04.860
Yeah. I have a mansion.

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:05.880
I'm a millionaire."

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.470
No, I don't like mean people,

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:10.181
so that is not really what I like.

00:15:10.181 --> 00:15:13.200
- One of my favorite authors, he said,

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.500
