00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.580
But yeah, life can be tough.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.213
It can be tough.

00:16:37.213 --> 00:16:38.421
Yeah.

00:16:38.421 --> 00:16:41.423
- I also think that your
lives were kind of harder

00:16:41.423 --> 00:16:44.250
