00:17:52.257 --> 00:17:54.123
- Well, life happens.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.183
- That's right.

00:17:56.183 --> 00:17:57.667
- And you have to deal with it.

00:17:57.667 --> 00:17:58.830
