00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:14.403
You can't feel sorry for
yourself when something happens.

00:18:14.403 --> 00:18:15.236
- That's right.

00:18:15.236 --> 00:18:17.232
- You have to help yourself.

00:18:17.232 --> 00:18:22.232
And it's how you deal
with the difficult time

00:18:22.650 --> 00:18:23.595
